{"parse": {"title": "奇闻邀请函", "pageid": 150086, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"奇闻邀请函\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b8/Item-401001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"奇闻邀请函\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>奇闻邀请函</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#401001</div></div><hr /><div>一封邀请函，将随机邀请一位未获得的6星角色（截至3.8版本的非限定角色）到访。<br />若已拥有范围内所有6星角色，将可自选1名6星角色。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">那是你好奇已久的秘密。橡树如何吐露神谕，谁人歌唱椰林与海岸，以梦境为食的生物摆动尾巴。将邀请函投入邮筒，一位未曾谋面的朋友将会来到你身边。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3003#3004#3007#3009#3025#3032#3039#3047#3048#3051#3052#3053#3056#3062#3063#3070#3072#3066#3079#3073#3074#3084#3065#3081#3077#3087#3088#3080#3094#3095#3097#3098#3102#3104#3105#3108#3109#3111#3114#3113#3116#3117#3107#3121#3126#3128#3125#3132#3135#3127#3092#3137#3139#3142#3143#3147#3144#3145#3140\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%82%E6%9C%AA%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81\" title=\"暂未支持\"><img alt=\"Bgequip2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/100px-Bgequip2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3